{
  "name": "Follow-up Reminder Automation V2 (Stale Enquiries >48h)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Follow-up Reminder Automation V2\n\n**Before activating:**\n1. Import the companion file **Follow-up Reminder V2 - Error Handler** first, then set its workflow ID in Settings > Error Workflow of this workflow.\n2. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named **Enquiries**. Headers in row 1: ID, Name, Email, Status, LastUpdated, LastReminderAt, ReminderSent, ReminderCount.\n3. Replace YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID in the three Google Sheets nodes with your sheet's ID (the long string in its URL).\n4. LastUpdated should be a real date/time or ISO text such as 2026-11-08T09:30:00+03:00.\n5. Select your Google Sheets and Telegram credentials on every node that uses them.\n6. Replace YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID in the Telegram nodes with your chat ID.\n7. Activate the workflow. It runs daily at 09:00 Africa/Kampala.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
